The live run also exposed an editor UI state issue: if the active Slate viewport is an asset/editor tab rather than a level viewport, Preview Lab capture can fail even though a level editor exists. `GetActiveLevelEditorViewportClient()` now falls back through the public `LevelEditor` module viewport interface before reporting no level viewport.

